WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.500
Can you describe its form?

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.000
No.

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.980
Was it carbon-based?

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.280
I don't know.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.600
Did it communicate with you?

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.620
It reacted to me.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.760
You really have no idea what it was.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.460
Did your husband contact you
at any point while he was away?

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.680
No.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.480
It was his decision to go in.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.520
Why did my husband
volunteer for a suicide mission?

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:24.120
You have to tell me where he was,
what he was doing.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.260
I need to know what's inside.

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:37.420
I could save Him

